   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "• Conﬁrm there is no rash, scabies, lice or insect bites. - If generalised itchy rash 84. - If localised itchy rash 85. • If itch around anus only 61.",
